//MCQs

::Spark-Memory-Management::
Which of the following is not the role of Executors in Spark?{
    = It executes the main() method of the program
    ~ It is responsible for running the task inside worker node 
    ~ It sends the result back to driver.
    ~ t can cache or persist the data in the worker node.
}

::Spark-Memory-Management::
Which of the following parameter in Spark is related with "Number of concurrent tasks that an executor can run"?{
    ~ spark.executor.instances
    = spark.executor.cores
    ~ spark.executor.memory
    ~ None of the above
}

